%N A081304 Number of numbers m <= n with prime factors less than 2*lpf(m), where lpf(m) is the least prime factor of m (A020639).
%C A081304 a(114) = A081305(114) = 57; a(n) >= n/2 for n <= 114, a(n) < n/2 for n > 114.
